Z||000002||mrfixit58||04-28-2000||09:08 AM||||You may want to call this guy. He is a local here in Florida and I've seen him at the last two Spring Daytona shows. His prices seem real reasonable and, like TOM, does this as a sideline.<P>John Webb<BR>1950 Murrell Rd., #9<BR>Rockledge, Fl 3295(8?)<P>407-636-8599<P>I've seen several of his pieces and they seem pretty good. I was there last year and he was selling AND installing the rear deck scoops for $90. I believe he also does the vented 1/4 windows that uses the lexan insert. He is a nice guy and can answer a lot of questions.<P>Roy||||reg||14
